 "source": "1181177cfffaac98",
 "code": "def subsets_with_dup(nums: list[int]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    nums = sorted(nums)\n    result: list[list[int]] = []\n    path: list[int] = []\n\n    def backtrack(start: int) -> None:\n        result.append(path[:])\n        for i in range(start, len(nums)):\n            if i > start and nums[i] == nums[i - 1]:\n                continue\n            path.append(nums[i])\n            backtrack(i + 1)\n            path.pop()\n\n    backtrack(0)\n    return result\n",
 "args": [
